  "description": "Reid Explorer | 12 inch kids' bike\nThe perfect first pedal bike for 1–3 year olds, the Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" Kids' Bike combines BMX-inspired styling with a confidence-building design to help little riders learn to pedal, steer and explore.\nBuilt around a strong steel frame, the Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" is ready for everyday adventures, from trips to the park and family rides to exploring the neighbourhood. BMX-style handlebars provide a comfortable riding position and responsive steering, helping young riders feel confident as they develop their cycling skills.\nA rear coaster brake makes stopping simple and intuitive, allowing children to brake by pedalling backwards. The full-length chainguard helps protect little fingers and clothing, while the junior-specific saddle and comfortable grips provide a secure and comfortable ride.\nWith its fun BMX-inspired style and child-friendly design, the Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" is an ideal first pedal bike for introducing young riders to the freedom and enjoyment of cycling.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Explorer 12\" bike for?\nThe Explorer 12\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n1–3 year olds ready for their first pedal bike\nToddlers developing confidence with pedalling and steering\nYoung riders learning to ride independently\nChildren who love BMX-inspired styling\nParents looking for a durable and easy-to-use first bike\nEveryday adventures, from park trips to family rides\nFind the right fit\n\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
